\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lead us heavenly Father, lead us
\par O'er the world's tempestuous sea;
\par Guard us, guide us, keep us, feed us,
\par For we have no help but Thee,
\par Yet possessing every blessing 
\par If our God our Father be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 2. Saviour, breathe forgiveness over us;
\par All our weakness Thou dost know;
\par Thou didst tread this earth before us,
\par Thou didst feel its keenest woe;
\par Lone and dreary, faint and weary,
\par Through the desert Thou didst go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit of our God, descending,
\par Fill our hearts with heavenly joy,
\par Love with every passion blending,
\par Pleasure that can never cloy;
\par Thus provided, pardoned, guided,
\par Nothing can our peace destroy.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

